<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chicago Bridge started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chicago Bridge started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Tobias Levkovich said Tuesday he had started coverage of Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron Co NV with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- He set a price target for the stock of $21.  His estimate for earnings per share was $1.85 this year and $2.10 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Plainfield, Ill., engineering and construction services company closed Monday at 17-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
